CAD Editor Recast is the next generation of the author's own CAD Editor.

Oriel UI 0.12.x (author: 云诺羲Rinorsi, https://github.com/Rinorsi/Oriel-UI)
provides the UI runtime. Release builds embed the unmodified slim 0.13.0 JAR;
external-dependency builds require a separately installed compatible Oriel.
Oriel is based on Vellum, Copyright (c) 2026 Max Leiter (MIT).
